## Appendix B: Key Formulas

```
1. Commutation Functions:
   Dx = lx × v^x        Cx = dx × v^(x+1)
   Nx = Σ Dx (age x to end)      Mx = Σ Cx (age x to end)

2. Net Single Premium (n-year term, per $1):
   NSP = (Mx − M(x+n)) / Dx

3. Annuity-Due Factor (n-year temporary, per $1):
   ä = (Nx − N(x+n)) / Dx

4. Net Annual Premium (per $1):
   NAP = NSP / ä

5. Prospective Reserve at time t:
   Reserve(t) = Face × [ (M(x+t) − M(x+n))/D(x+t) − NAP × (N(x+t) − N(x+n))/D(x+t) ]
```

